{"body": [{"y0": 66.9, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 202.1, "text": "PENSVM B"}, {"y0": 80.6, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.4, "text": "Màrcus — Quinti est. Quintus ünum fratrem et ünam —"}, {"y0": 94.6, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 403.3, "text": "habet. 'Iülia' — soróris est. Fráter Aemiliae est — liberorum."}, {"y0": 108.3, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 404.4, "text": "Quintus: *Ubi est avunculus noster?\" Iülius: *Avunculus —"}, {"y0": 122.5, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 224.0, "text": "est in Germànià.\""}, {"y0": 136.7, "x0": 160.1, "x1": 404.6, "text": "Provincia est — imperii Romani. Rhenus Germàniam ab"}, {"y0": 150.6, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 404.6, "text": "imperio Romàno —; Rhénus — imperii est. In Germànià"}, {"y0": 164.4, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 404.7, "text": "mulü — Rómàni sunt, qui contrà Germànós —; Germàni"}, {"y0": 178.3, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 404.6, "text": "enim — Romanorum sunt. Milites Rómàni scüta et — et pila"}, {"y0": 192.3, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.6, "text": "—.. Milites in — habitant. Circum castra est — et —, quod x"}, {"y0": 206.4, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 339.9, "text": "pedés — est. Milites patriam ab hostibus —."}, {"y0": 234.1, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 202.8, "text": "PENSVM C"}, {"y0": 248.0, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 276.9, "text": "Num 'Maàrcus' cognomen est?"}, {"y0": 261.8, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 267.4, "text": "Quot fratres habet Aemilia?"}, {"y0": 275.7, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 290.4, "text": "Quid agit Aemilius in Germàniàa?"}, {"y0": 289.7, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 288.1, "text": "Quae arma pedes Rómànus fert?"}, {"y0": 303.6, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 291.9, "text": "Quam longum est pilum Aemilii?"}, {"y0": 317.6, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 275.3, "text": "Ubi habitant milites Rómàni?"}, {"y0": 331.3, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 264.9, "text": "Qui sunt Germàni et Galli?"}, {"y0": 345.3, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 302.0, "text": "Estne Germània provincia Rómàna?"}, {"y0": 358.5, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 328.8, "text": "Quod flümen Germaniam à Gallià dividit?"}, {"y0": 373.2, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 328.1, "text": "Cür hostés castra expugnàre nón possunt?"}, {"y0": 387.3, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 287.0, "text": "Num miles fortis ab hoste fugit?"}, {"y0": 401.0, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 289.9, "text": "Cür hasta procul iaci nón potest?"}], "margin": [{"y0": 68.5, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 80.6, "text": "equitatus"}, {"y0": 77.5, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 76.6, "text": "impetus"}, {"y0": 88.1, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 69.6, "text": "metus"}, {"y0": 97.5, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 70.5, "text": "versus"}, {"y0": 104.7, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 66.2, "text": "milia"}, {"y0": 113.7, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 68.0, "text": "tristis"}, {"y0": 123.6, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 76.6, "text": "armàátus"}, {"y0": 132.0, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 69.8, "text": "brevis"}, {"y0": 141.4, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 69.2, "text": "gravis"}, {"y0": 150.4, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 64.2, "text": "levis"}, {"y0": 159.4, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 79.5, "text": "barbarus"}, {"y0": 168.4, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 64.7, "text": "altus"}, {"y0": 177.4, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 64.7, "text": "latus"}, {"y0": 186.4, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 66.7, "text": "fortis"}, {"y0": 197.2, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 69.2, "text": "vester"}, {"y0": 204.8, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 65.1, "text": "ferre"}, {"y0": 214.8, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 77.3, "text": "pugnàre"}, {"y0": 223.3, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 76.3, "text": "incolere"}, {"y0": 232.3, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 77.3, "text": "dividere"}, {"y0": 242.2, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 86.3, "text": "oppugnare"}, {"y0": 252.1, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 77.2, "text": "metuere"}, {"y0": 259.5, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 75.7, "text": "militàre"}, {"y0": 268.5, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 83.5, "text": "defendere"}, {"y0": 277.7, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 69.1, "text": "iacere"}, {"y0": 287.7, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 85.3, "text": "expugnare"}, {"y0": 295.8, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 70.5, "text": "fugere"}, {"y0": 305.9, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 70.5, "text": "contràá"}, {"y0": 316.2, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 55.7, "text": "ac"}, {"y0": 323.2, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 87.6, "text": "adiectivum"}, {"y0": 332.7, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 96.1, "text": "comparátivus"}]}